    "detailed_description": "This game is a mix of two genres - <strong>Tover Defense</strong> and <strong>Survival</strong>. You have to get into the times of feudal fragmentation and put an end to this era.<br><br><strong>The main point of </strong> is to capture new territories, build and expand your base to repel the raids of feudal lords and other inhabitants of this era<br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Raise cattle and farm<br></li><li>Get resources and use crafting to create the right items<br></li><li>Explore the huge map and capture new territories to expand your principality<br></li><li>Fight various bosses to prevent the destruction of your possessions<br></li><li>Find secret corners and objects hidden all over the map<br></li><li>Face the natural difficulties of each of the biomes<br></li><li>Enjoy a very simple and at the same time addictive gameplay</li></ul>",
